		(property "Description" "12 V battery input, AMASS XT30PW-M right-angle PCB male (15 A continuous, 30 A short-term, 500 V), keyed. Pin 2 (+ silkscreen) = battery + to F1; pin 1 (- silkscreen) = GND. Mates with an XT30U-F plug on the battery harness: DJLBERMPW 12V 50Ah LiFePO4 M8 terminals -> M8 ring lugs -> inline fuse at the battery -> 16 AWG -> XT30U-F."
